{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t消委會今年首9個月，接獲3078宗涉及客戶服務的投訴，按年升近6成，超越去年全年個案的總數，當中涉及AI投訴的個案，升幅超過140%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n消委會表示，現階段難以訂立強制性框架，要求商戶在特定情況下，必須轉至真人客服。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：朱錫君\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T12:00:13.151531+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T11:47:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T12:37:38.992439+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T11:57:45.370876+00:00","content_hash":"b7a62d8bf4fda5f59e36aaffa5f3fea6875b7becfb565c5b7cefc2ac92ac2287","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}